{"title":"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Eight semicircles line the inside of a square with side length 2 as shown. What is the radius of the circle tangent to all of these semicircles?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/2/1b29aadcfb289d9056e0d9324532b3b175bc79c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } \\dfrac{1+\\sqrt2}4 \\quad \\text{(B) } \\dfrac{\\sqrt5-1}2 \\quad \\text{(C) } \\dfrac{\\sqrt3+1}4 \\quad \\text{(D) } \\dfrac{2\\sqrt3}5 \\quad \\text{(E) } \\dfrac{\\sqrt5}3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"461\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/3/aa3449d7a1f5549a72c1e5be22ee89bd4499ee51.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] scale(200); draw(scale(.5)*((-1,-1)--(1,-1)--(1,1)--(-1,1)--cycle)); path p = arc((.25,-.5),.25,0,180)--arc((-.25,-.5),.25,0,180); draw(p); p=rotate(90)*p; draw(p); p=rotate(90)*p; draw(p); p=rotate(90)*p; draw(p); draw(scale((sqrt(5)-1)/4)*unitcircle); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We connect the centers of the circle and one of the semicircles, then draw the perpendicular from the center of the middle circle to that side, as shown.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/f/f5f12073b2d89af4810a457ff1ec79f235f2098e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] scale(200); draw(scale(.5)*((-1,-1)--(1,-1)--(1,1)--(-1,1)--cycle)); path p = arc((.25,-.5),.25,0,180)--arc((-.25,-.5),.25,0,180); draw(p); p=rotate(90)*p; draw(p); p=rotate(90)*p; draw(p); p=rotate(90)*p; draw(p); draw(scale((sqrt(5)-1)/4)*unitcircle); pair OO=(0,0); pair XX=(-.25,-.5); pair YY=(0,-.5); draw(YY--OO--XX--cycle,black+1bp); label(&quot;$\\frac12$&quot;,.5*(XX+YY),S); label(&quot;$1$&quot;,.5*YY,E); [/asy]\" width=\"222\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p>We will start by creating an equation by the Pythagorean theorem: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/1/1e1ac7515df8c8dee73da68c2981b421de64d860.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{1^2 + \\left(\\frac12\\right)^2} = \\sqrt{\\frac54} = \\frac{\\sqrt5}{2}.\\]\" width=\"213\" height=\"53\" />\n</p><p><br />\nLet's call <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> as the radius of the circle that we want to find. We see that the hypotenuse of the bold right triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96a3cbe5591883ee94fb9ef9b64e5b3fbef41f3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{1}{2}+r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"43\" height=\"37\" />, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/a/eaaf1c34a6dc7b30611904dd1c58b5bcd13a99a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)} \\frac{\\sqrt{5}-1}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"99\" height=\"53\" />.\n</p><p>-- LORD_ERTY09\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B\">2014 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2014 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"201